Moss Fix (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "Moss Fix Remastered" by gamma-02
(https://github.com/gamma-02/moss-fix-remastered, MIT, 549k downloads
on Modrinth, max Minecraft 1.21.9).

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
gamma-02. This port was created by Itamio to bring the mod to
Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric) because the original has not been updated
to this version.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).
Port changes: the core bonemeal fix is preserved (target class is
BonemealableFeaturePlacerBlock in 26.3, was MossBlock before
1.21.2); the optional datapack spread system (cobblestone/sand) is
not ported.
